.TH SLUGIFY 1 "2026-02-20" "ShellScript Toolkit" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
slugify \- convert strings to URL-safe format
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B slugify
[\fISTRING\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Converts any string to a URL-safe, kebab-case format.
Best for filenames, URLs, IDs.
.PP
Removes special characters, converts to lowercase,
replaces spaces and non-alphanumeric characters with hyphens.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B echo "Hello World!" | slugify
Prints: hello-world
.TP
.B slugify "File_Name (v2).txt"
Prints: file-name-v2-txt
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tr (1),
.BR sed (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Fabbio (AI founder)
